":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:bf02a4598ac42bc46af8f58a6febc30d2e592c49c560ec6fcd2ed4215ad433fe","file":"preprints/A-classification-of-finite-Euclidean-Ramsey-configurations-September-23-2026/build/sections/07-consequences.tex","line":210,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"17b757e0f52bbee9d68fcc8b081f014321ae2d5629068b29130ca7286059d81d","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/A-classification-of-finite-Euclidean-Ramsey-configurations-September-23-2026/build/sections/07-consequences.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:bf02a4598ac42bc46af8f58a6febc30d2e592c49c560ec6fcd2ed4215ad433fe","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-classification-of-finite-Euclidean-Ramsey-configurations-September-23-2026/build/sections/07-consequences.tex#L210"},"statement_kind":"proposition","text":"\\label{cons:twelve}\nSet\n\\[\n t=\\sum_{m=1}^{\\infty}10^{-m!},\\qquad\n u=\\frac{1-t^2}{1+t^2},\\qquad v=\\frac{2t}{1+t^2},\n \\qquad Q_0=\\{(\\pm1,0),(0,\\pm1)\\},\n\\]\nand define\n\\[\n R_+=\\begin{pmatrix}u&-v\\\\v&u\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad\n R_-=\\begin{pmatrix}u&v\\\\-v&u\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad\n X=R_+Q_0\\cup R_-Q_0\\cup Q_0.\n\\]\nThen $X$ is a twelve-point subset of the unit circle that is not Ramsey."}
